{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":660599,\"title\":\"Sirley\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Nina is 13 years old and has an incredibly messy family. She finds herself catapulted from the center of Rome in a suburban neighborhood: grey high-rises, boys on scooters and a funny grandmother who spends all of her time gambling on cards. A sudden encounter upsets everything, like a storm: she is 13 years old, lives in the opposite building, and dances the Lambada. Her name is Sirley, she comes from French Guiana and has an ambitious dream: to interpret the Madonna in the neighborhood procession. Between the two an intense, very strong bond is created. Their friendship will lead Nina to finally lose control, and to discover her place not only in the world, but in the heart of her family.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ojJBnLgY6JNKW0PiUNUZcMb4obK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yjpR3p1gapGAUv9eICwg1GUeRiF.jpg\",\"rating\":5.6,\"voteCount\":38,\"year\":2021,\"runtime\":90,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"IT\",\"name\":\"Italy\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Elisa Amoruso\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":128452,\"name\":\"Elisa Amoruso\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/voOw4ySUEaQcS7J8CYXVIwlc7p3.jpg\"},{\"id\":126983,\"name\":\"Micaela Ramazzotti\",\"character\":\"Laura\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6b3BGvkMFU5A2e4cqp6GmFzZkSL.jpg\"},{\"id\":130359,\"name\":\"Giampaolo Morelli\",\"character\":\"Enzo\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5KATYXO5KRV0VrFt6UhlQxFWm3m.jpg\"},{\"id\":2498860,\"name\":\"Emma Fasano\",\"character\":\"Nina\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q4ZsBBYRUUwPqPLE3thxwcu8HDf.jpg\"},{\"id\":2152949,\"name\":\"Manon Bresch\",\"character\":\"Sirley\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qv3atQzKpIDhZ9oK0hVuPRC2xUy.jpg\"},{\"id\":2276743,\"name\":\"Federico Ielapi\",\"character\":\"Lorenzo\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p33lZFTgJkuaGzlrGXudDMHE1lH.jpg\"},{\"id\":1183889,\"name\":\"Orietta Notari\",\"character\":\"Sister Caterina\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zhyE0pVwkdmtUCml5uu2mBm5Gu1.jpg\"},{\"id\":2806999,\"name\":\"Clara Galante\",\"character\":\"Sister Maria\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":100412,\"name\":\"Sara Franchetti\",\"character\":\"Grandma Adriana\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9accAJY6vp4YtRmJe5R9jNuyr1d.jpg\"},{\"id\":1496177,\"name\":\"Massimo Cagnina\",\"character\":\"Cicala\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ubD8neHTvpY7CL2AK5djGMEGovO.jpg\"},{\"id\":103183,\"name\":\"Eliana Miglio\",\"character\":\"Alba\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1EwinbSwWiPrULsnrvcCRYJEAn.jpg\"},{\"id\":67174,\"name\":\"Fabrizia Sacchi\",\"character\":\"Mother Sirley\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zBjLm24LOdAA2PnRdryvgUefcxN.jpg\"},{\"id\":119950,\"name\":\"Claudio Bigagli\",\"character\":\"Priest\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Au3H49qjanQA2hYIrN6tNyyirxy.jpg\"},{\"id\":1875053,\"name\":\"Rosa Enginoli Gerini\",\"character\":\"Azzurra\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2280749,\"name\":\"Francesca Giordano\",\"character\":\"Concetta\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1514026,\"title\":\"Buddy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1BdZbNvl1SfrrX8J9X5tQzN6Ivu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sMmG82PtjK8A9rVc34gwKQtCm3A.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Inside the colorful world of \\\"It's Buddy!\\\", a group of children spend their days singing, dancing, and helping Buddy - bright orange unicorn - spread happiness. But when one child refuses to play along, Buddy is not pleased and cracks begin to appear in this seemingly perfect world.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1153576,\"title\":\"Street Fighter\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ccxdepKqORLwccbzvO4eAGkN0IC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zDE9hd1SG9695YncbZGjSf7Z9Jk.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1993, estranged Street Fighters Ryu and Ken Masters are thrown back into combat when the mysterious Chun-Li recruits them for the next World Warrior Tournament: a brutal clash of fists, fate, and fury. But behind this battle royale lies a deadly conspiracy that forces them to face off against each other and the demons of their past. And if they don't, it's GAME OVER!\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1084244,\"title\":\"Toy Story 5\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sfQtVlIHljToOwYjhe21KPGzZWK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qjTqY5coNiz6sVtPng40IzltsoN.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Bonnie receives a Lilypad tablet as a gift and becomes obsessed, Buzz, Woody, Jessie and the rest of the gang's jobs become exponentially harder when they have to go head to head with the all-new threat to playtime.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1465063,\"title\":\"Forgotten Island\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/myd1K3gefdNAWFsGNRDdMeiK9Qg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2o9FzuBzCqrDTdlHRuEVnGD2d5h.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"While celebrating their last night together, high school graduates and best friends Jo and Raissa stumble upon a mysterious portal that transports them to the fantastical island of Nakali. When they discover that the memories of their entire friendship are the price for returning home, Jo and Raissa must race to find a way to leave the island before they forget each other forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1204680,\"title\":\"Coyote vs. Acme\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kYDCl2y0VPvhT5eYWbMRInPoB03.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rueyXwlewVPAP5NkqCUJx4RjhqB.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After Acme products fail him one too many times in his dogged pursuit of the Roadrunner, Wile E. Coyote decides to hire a billboard lawyer to sue the Acme Corporation.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1108427,\"title\":\"Moana\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gaet1xQ2nxrG0V1Ep9T20ZMNEIC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c6BPbkO5Npt1OdwttAxCFo06wtH.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Teenage Moana answers the Ocean's call and, for the first time, voyages beyond the reef of her island of Motunui with infamous demigod Maui on an unforgettable journey to restore prosperity to her people.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":891621,\"title\":\"Wild Horse Nine\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dNJFRtVg3xLQ7dbNIQ55cmmIniD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3uLA0ujne91bkzFStZICCYeqhnt.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Shortly before the 1973 Chilean coup, CIA agents Chris and Lee are dispatched from Santiago to Easter Island by their bureau chief, MJ. Amongst the Island's iconic statues, and as the longtime partners wrestle with their dark pasts and present conspiracies, Chris's newfound bond with a pair of rebellious students threatens to send everyone’s trip to this remote paradise sideways.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1148365,\"title\":\"Matchbox the Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aHhHRz6nOpwkqJs5ASeRGAdK2dt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jdJsnhHfkIi3J7jwfiCFT4gXNx5.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a group of former childhood friends reconnect, their reunion takes a wild turn as they stumble upon a dangerous international plot—and must save the world.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1315772,\"title\":\"Minions & Monsters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4LwvU9SZc8QQzW1X1FAPhNbXnEU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kkcwhgSFd81QDlXo8ytrpHPQjhy.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This is the rambunctious, ridiculous and totally true story of how the Minions conquered Hollywood, became movie stars, lost everything, unleashed monsters onto the world and then banded together to try and save the planet from the mayhem they had just created.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1377237,\"title\":\"Runner\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vJk2TW1QZAmBiD7oj9ZF9EPTYY1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/npXZNWjOEYrqdMDPQ11SGBrXqAG.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A former soldier is thrown into a brutal race against time when a critical medical delivery makes him and his unlikely partner the targets of a ruthless cartel. As the mission spirals into a deadly manhunt, every detour, delay, and bullet pushes them closer to failure. With betrayal closing in from every side, they must survive the chase and deliver their cargo to save the life of a little girl.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":533535,\"title\":\"Deadpool & Wolverine\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8cdWjvZQUExUUTzyp4t6EDMubfO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/by8z9Fe8y7p4jo2YlW2SZDnptyT.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A listless Wade Wilson toils away in civilian life with his days as the morally flexible mercenary, Deadpool, behind him. But when his homeworld faces an existential threat, Wade must reluctantly suit-up again with an even more reluctant Wolverine.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Comedy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":496243,\"title\":\"Parasite\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7IiTTgloJzvGI1TAYymCfbfl3vT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/TU9NIjwzjoKPwQHoHshkFcQUCG.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"All unemployed, Ki-taek's family takes peculiar interest in the wealthy and glamorous Parks for their livelihood until they get entangled in an unexpected incident.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"hjBeKNHIdMY\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"X2oA35q212E\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"45aCYjH4-AU\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}